{"id":"n2-048","title":"～かねる","romaji":"〜kaneru","jlptLevel":2,"shortExplanation":"Express inability or impossibility of doing an action (often as a polite refusal).","longExplanation":"The ～かねる grammar point is used to express that someone cannot do an action or that something is impossible to do. It typically has a nuance of reluctance or polite refusal and is formed by adding かねる to the ます-stem of the verb.","formation":"Verb-ます stem + かねる","examples":[{"jp":"その問題は難しいので、私には解決しかねます。","romaji":"Sono mondai wa muzukashii no de, watashi ni wa kaiketsu shi-kanemasu.","en":"Since that problem is difficult, I cannot solve it.","words":[{"surface":"その","vocabId":null},{"surface":"問題","vocabId":"1536010","reading":"もんだい"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"難しい","vocabId":"1460850","reading":"むずかしい"},{"surface":"ので","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"私","vocabId":"1311110","reading":"わたし"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"解決","vocabId":"1198960","reading":"かいけつ"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"かね","vocabId":"1242590","reading":"かね","baseForm":"かねる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[11]},{"jp":"彼の言っていることが真実かどうか判断しかねます。","romaji":"Kare no itte iru koto ga shinjitsu ka dō ka handan shi-kanemasu.","en":"I cannot judge whether what he is saying is true or not.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"言っ","vocabId":"1587040","reading":"いう","baseForm":"言う"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いる","vocabId":"1577980","reading":"いる"},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"真実","vocabId":"1363780","reading":"しんじつ"},{"surface":"か","vocabId":null},{"surface":"どう","vocabId":"1451730","reading":"どう"},{"surface":"か","vocabId":null},{"surface":"判断","vocabId":"1478620","reading":"はんだん"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"かね","vocabId":"1242590","reading":"かね","baseForm":"かねる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[13]},{"jp":"彼女が来るかどうか今すぐには分かりかねます。","romaji":"Kanojo ga kuru ka dō ka ima sugu ni wa wakari-kanemasu.","en":"I cannot immediately know whether she will come or not.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"来る","vocabId":"1547720","reading":"くる"},{"surface":"か","vocabId":null},{"surface":"どう","vocabId":"1451730","reading":"どう"},{"surface":"か","vocabId":null},{"surface":"今","vocabId":"1288850","reading":"いま"},{"surface":"すぐ","vocabId":"1430610","reading":"すぐ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"分かり","vocabId":"1502940","reading":"わかり","baseForm":"分かる"},{"surface":"かね","vocabId":"1242590","reading":"かね","baseForm":"かねる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[11]},{"jp":"詳しい内容については説明しかねます。","romaji":"Kuwashii naiyō ni tsuite wa setsumei shi-kanemasu.","en":"I cannot explain the details.","words":[{"surface":"詳しい","vocabId":"1351730","reading":"くわしい"},{"surface":"内容","vocabId":"1459400","reading":"ないよう"},{"surface":"について","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"説明","vocabId":"1386460","reading":"せつめい"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"かね","vocabId":"1242590","reading":"かね","baseForm":"かねる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[6]}]}